        "purpose": "Measure CPU topology, affinity, hardware counters, region markers and memory bandwidth with architecture-specific metric groups.",
        "qualification_gaps": [
          "A physical target CPU, kernel, PMU and container launch profile must pass feature-specific collection probes; an installed executable is not full runtime qualification.",
          "Full uncore access may require host MSR/PCI access or access daemon; perf_event mode alone is not equivalent.",
          "No frequency-setting tool may change a formal timing machine during a campaign."
        ],
